        <p>' Tenders. COUNTY BOROUGH OF WARRINGTON'. The Finance Committee of the Corporation invite TENDERS from Local' Printers and Stationers for the, supply of PRINTING and STATIONERY required by the various depart- ments of the Corporation during the next twelve months. Specifications, with conditions as to rates of 'wages and hours of labour, can be obtained on and after Monday next, from the Borough Treasurer, Sankey-street, on deposit of 10s.. which will be returned on receipt of a bona-fide • tender. Tenders, securely fastened, addressed to the Chairman of the Finance Committee, and endorsed "Tender for Printing and Stationery," must be delivered to the undersigned on or before Saturday, the 11th November, 1916. J. LYON WHITTLE, Town Clerk. Town' Hall. Warrington, 27th October, 1916.</p>
