        <p>TO-DAY'S MATCHES. St. Elphin's v. Howley 'United; Mr. H. Berry. Widnes Juniors v. Widnes St. Mary's; Mr. G. Marsh. Penketh Juniors v. Appleton Hornets; Mr. T. A Smith. Latchford Cadets v. Grappenhall; Mr. J. Wright. Bewsey A.S. v. Highfield; Mr. C. Gosling. Orford Juniors v. Latchford Recs. 't • TEAMS FOR TO-DAY. EMMANUEL A.F.C. v. SANKEY A. In the Park. Kick-off at 3.15 p.m. Emmanuel Team: H. Wright; -J. Hallara, T. Hughes;' W. Ayres, E. Hardy (capt.), F. Parr; W. Eaton, H. Stubbs, T. Hughes, W. Knight and W. Hartkinson. Reserves: F. Hughes and R. Wright. ST. ELPHIN'S v. HOWLEY UNITED. At Steel-street. Kick-off 3.15 p.m. Howley. United: Walters; Foster, Rowlinson; Hind, Atherton, Miller; Hibbert, Fitzgerald, Davies, i Hassan and Humphries. 'l. Reserves: Hoarty and Winstanley. St. Elphin's: W. Povey; W. Tunstall (capt.), V. Furness; D. Cooper, H. Miller, H. Gleave; W. Wat- son, G. England, W. Lee. A. Jones and J. Holden. Reserve: J. Barton. Referee, Mr. H. Berry. CADETS v. GRAPPENHALL. At Victoria. Park. Cadets: S. Miller; W. Massey, G. Crannigan; G. Appleton, S. Gibson (capt.), R. Hope; W. Daven- port, S. Jones, J. Clarke, F. Sankey and J. Mayers. Reserves: F. Plumb and F. Bradshaw.</p>
